flowchart TB
    CLI[CLI / API adapter] --> WF[FeatureWorkflowOrchestrator]

    WF --> SO[SpecifyOrchestrator]
    WF --> PO[PlanOrchestrator]
    WF --> TO[TasksOrchestrator]
    WF --> IO[ImplementOrchestrator]

    SO --> VG1[ValidatedGenerationOrchestrator]
    PO --> VG2[ValidatedGenerationOrchestrator]
    TO --> VG3[ValidatedGenerationOrchestrator]
    IO --> TE[TaskExecutionOrchestrator]

    VG1 --> Actions[Single-responsibility actions]
    VG2 --> Actions
    VG3 --> Actions
    TE --> Actions

    Actions --> Ports[Typed ports]
    Ports --> FS[Filesystem / transaction adapter]
    Ports --> LLM[Model provider adapter]
    Ports --> PARSE[Markdown, data, AST parsers]
    Ports --> CMD[Restricted command runner]
    Ports --> PRESET[Config and preset repository]

    Actions --> VAL[Deterministic diagnostics]
    VAL --> RO[AtomicRepairOrchestrator]
    RO --> Actions
